@page "/components/table"

<PageTitle>Table — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Table</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A real <code>&lt;table&gt;</code> in a scroll container, with the caption where a caption
    belongs. The element is the accessibility: row and column headers, the announced dimensions,
    and navigation by cell all come from it and from nothing else.
</p>

